{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cal\u00edgine</strong> is a classic Point-and-Click graphic adventure that takes you to the unsettling mountain village of <i>Hillside Ridge</i>. A handcrafted narrative experience. <br>As a detective, your mission is to investigate the disappearance of a colleague\u2014a case that initially seems routine but soon reveals dark secrets tied to the village's enigmatic past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441660/extras/a13675535fc9f6c504a3993b7e37faea.poster.avif?t=1772806911\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441660/extras/a13675535fc9f6c504a3993b7e37faea.webm?t=1772806911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441660/extras/a13675535fc9f6c504a3993b7e37faea.mp4?t=1772806911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is set in the fascinating universe of <strong>Par\u00e1metro Zero</strong>, a fiction born from an extensive role-playing campaign that has brought to life a world filled with stories, complex characters, and mysteries waiting to be uncovered. As you explore the village, you will solve challenging puzzles and uncover fragments of <i>Hillside Ridge</i>'s hidden history, where echoes of ancient secrets still linger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441660/extras/13f249c9286ba944e782d530087f1922.poster.avif?t=1772806911\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441660/extras/13f249c9286ba944e782d530087f1922.webm?t=1772806911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441660/extras/13f249c9286ba944e782d530087f1922.mp4?t=1772806911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its somber atmosphere, intriguing characters, and carefully crafted setting, <strong>Cal\u00edgine</strong> delivers an experience that blends the nostalgia of traditional graphic adventures with a mature and captivating narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you dare to uncover the secrets hidden in <i>Hillside Ridge</i>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441660/extras/1fefa38d281ade69f1ec0a4beb758a12.poster.avif?t=1772806911\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441660/extras/1fefa38d281ade69f1ec0a4beb758a12.webm?t=1772806911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441660/extras/1fefa38d281ade69f1ec0a4beb758a12.mp4?t=1772806911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3441660?t=1772806911","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441660/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772806911","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441660/3113ca87ec8e1aefb2090d749cfcce5fcce03ad6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772806911","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441660/3113ca87ec8e1aefb2090d749cfcce5fcce03ad6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772806911","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"This game contains themes of violence, drug use